vestments.</p><p>The Department of Agriculture and the Government Accountability Office must each analyze and report on foreign influence in the U.S. agricultural industry.</p>","updateDate":"2025-03-17T18:54:07Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"FARM Act","type":"s","updateDate":"2026-07-21T11:03:19Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-21T11:03:19Z"}
